            "description": {
              "value": "You pummel a held foe, hoping to stagger them. Make a melee Strike against a creature you have grabbed. The weapon damage from this Strike is bludgeoning damage. If the Strike hits, the creature must attempt a Fortitude save against your class DC; this is an incapacitation effect.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is stunned 1.\n- **Failure:** The creature is stunned 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is stunned 3."
